                <pb facs="0079" n="47" xml:id="pg47"/>
                <p>The Soviet Union is estimated to have a force of submarine-launched missiles
                    during the years 1960-1963 approximately equal to our own.<anchor n="d"
                        xml:id="d17-f6"/></p>
                <p>The number of ICBM missiles launched (successful
                    and unsuccessful) as of 14 February 1961 is estimated to be:</p>
                <table cols="3" rows="5">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell/>
                        <cell><hi rendition="#italic">U.S.</hi></cell>
                        <cell><hi rendition="#italic">Soviet</hi></cell>
                    </row>
